{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:14 2026-10-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:14 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:14 2026-10-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"吳康民逝世 享年100歲\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa8aa7b68f591c1a8d9bbf1efde722d7/2026-10/A33_1.jpg\"/><p>前港區人大代表、培僑中學前校長吳康民逝世，享年100歲。吳康民是本港愛國陣營元老級人物。</p><p>全國政協副主席、前特首梁振英於社交平台表示「沉痛悼念吳康民校長」。</p><img alt=\"前港區人大代表、培僑中學前校長吳康民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/171b1cea9b4bd6c4ab9a2e3766c5d976/2026-10/DNS81105CHIUCHOW006.jpg\" title=\"前港區人大代表、培僑中學前校長吳康民。\"/><p>前港區人大代表、培僑中學前校長吳康民。</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:18:46.680521+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:14:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T07:17:32.303108+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:17:32.303108+00:00","content_hash":"b2663d0de1103a093d35d48376c44f68c93d5d270925956faffe6852f62364ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}